{"id":6312,"chapter_id":6,"scene_id":609,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"彼女の戦いは泥沼にはまってしまったかのように終わりがない。絶えることのない穢れが彼女の進む道を塞いでいる。","style":3,"background":602,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"ゾーヤ","content":"俺の戦いに終わりはない……永遠に続く……","voice":["vo_cgplot_6212002"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":602,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"speaker":"ゾーヤ","content":"スタートもゴールもない。敵がいれば、それでいい……俺一人で十分だ……","voice":["vo_cgplot_6212003"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":602,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"speaker":"ゾーヤ","content":"俺はずっと……","voice":["vo_cgplot_6212004"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":602,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"content":"彼女は右手を上げ、拳を握って戦いを続けようとする。その手首に赤い紋様が見え隠れする。","style":3,"background":602,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"speaker":"ゾーヤ","content":"これは……何の痕跡だ？","voice":["vo_cgplot_6212006"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":602,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"speaker":"ゾーヤ","content":"誰かが俺に抗ってる……誰かが……まだ戦ってるのか？","voice":["vo_cgplot_6212007"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":602,"log_type":1}]}